{"severity":"error","file":"errors/codec_missing_2.march","start_line":16,"start_col":12,"end_line":16,"end_col":76,"message":"`Node.enqueue` needs a JSON codec for `Ping`, and none is derived.\nA remote message crosses the network as JSON, and its type's name is its wire tag; a receiver decodes it with `from_json`.","code":"codec_missing","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["Add `derive Json for Ping` next to its declaration."],"category":"ACTOR"}
